      "✅ Take the tour — done!\n\nStart here:\n1️⃣ Run a Vendor Assessment\n2️⃣ Generate your first Compliance Report\n3️⃣ Check the Compliance Calendar\n\nDJAC has your back. Go make compliance easy! 💪",
